{"id":"442711","name":"玉米山药汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/442711/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米","amount":"2根"},{"name":"山药","amount":"300g"},{"name":"马蹄","amount":"8粒"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"3根"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"瘦肉飞水，洗净。","img":"images/442711/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"玉米切小段。","img":"images/442711/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮切小块。","img":"images/442711/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"马蹄去皮洗净。","img":"images/442711/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"山药去皮切块。","img":"images/442711/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把以上材料放入电压力锅内锅，注入适量的水。","img":"images/442711/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"按煲汤键开煮。","img":"images/442711/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"汤好后，放盐调味即可。(我家的汤一般不放盐的)","img":"images/442711/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"清甜滋润，健脾开胃。","img":"images/442711/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}